# Evil Video Creator

This is a simple application that converts text to video using Google Text-to-Speech and MoviePy.

## Installation

1. Clone the repository:
   ```
   git clone https://github.com/evilcorp/evil-video-creator.git
   ```

2. Install the required packages:
   ```
   pip install -r requirements.txt
   ```

## Usage

Run the application with the following command:
python main.py "Your text here" output_video.mp4

This will create a video file named `output_video.mp4` with the provided text.

